extends layout

block main
  section.section
    div.page-head
      h1 About
      p.page-intro fwb is a band making happy, loud, slightly ridiculous music &mdash; best enjoyed at highway-legal moped speeds.

    div.about-card
      div.about-media
        div.media-placeholder(aria-hidden="true")
          span Band photo
      div.about-info
        h2 The band
        p We started fwb because being friends was already going great and we figured we would push our luck. Two-part harmonies, one shared helmet, and songs about summer, snacks, and questionable decisions. Replace this copy with the real story behind the band.
        p Whether it is a quiet single or a backyard packed with people, we care about the details that make the whole thing feel like a good time.

    div.about-card.reverse
      div.about-media
        div.media-placeholder(aria-hidden="true")
          span Live photo
      div.about-info
        h2 What we do
        ul
          li Writing and recording new music
          li Playing live shows and sessions
          li Collaborating with other artists
        p Want to work together or book a show? Head to the contact page and say hello.
